      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Hotspot Bot_Payment Confirmation & Voucher Delivery\n\nTriggered by Paystack charge.success webhook.\nForks on arrival: logs raw event to Google Sheets (forensic record) and runs validation in parallel.\nValidation path: checks status = success + gateway_response = Approved + event = charge.success, extracts metadata, calls MikroTik REST API to generate a voucher, merges voucher with payment data, delivers credentials to customer via Telegram, logs confirmed transaction to Google Sheets, and alerts admin via Discord webhook.",
